# Training Tuning & Diagnostics

Read the rule matching your current task:

- **Launch / resume / stop a run** (GPU env setup, `gpu_env.sh`, nohup launch, monitoring, clean stop): see `training-launch`
- **Hyperparameter selection** (c_puct, network depth/width, lr, Dirichlet, opponent pool by game type): see `training-hyperparams`
- **Diagnose issues** (symptom-to-cause checklist, concurrent inference setup, known BUGs): see `training-diagnostics`
